{"id":"31.5.6.2","doc":"T","title":"Dual Filter Mode","words":122,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Dual Filter Mode is enabled by clearing the "},{"t":"field","v":"TWAI_RX_FILTER_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" bit to 0."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"This will cause the "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" code and mask values to define a two separate filters referred to as filter 1 or filter 2."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Under Dual Filter Mode, a message will be accepted if it is accepted by one of the two filters."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The two filters can filter the following bits of a data or remote frame:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"SFF"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The entire "},{"t":"num","v":"11-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" ID"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"RTR bit"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Data byte 1 (for filter 1 only)"}]}]}]]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"EFF"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The first 16 bits of the "},{"t":"num","v":"29-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" ID"}]}]}]]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Figure 31.5-3 illustrates how the "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" code and mask values will be interpreted in Dual Filter Mode."}]}]},{"t":"fig","src":"images/trm-fig-31_5-3.png","alt":"Figure 31.5-3. Dual Filter Mode"}]}